OL,3,C'I heard a crackle': Woman on moment
OL,4,Cshe believes Suffolk wildfire started
OL,6,FCharlotte Du Cann, a local in the
OL,7,Farea, said she was on a walk with a
OL,8,Ffriend when she saw a "ring of fire"
OL,9,Fthat was around 20 feet long
OL,11,FA woman has described witnessing the
OL,12,Fmoment she believes the Suffolk
OL,13,Fwildfire started, telling ITV News
OL,14,Fthere was "no one around".
OL,16,FCharlotte Du Cann, a local, said she
OL,17,Fwas walking back from Dunwich Heath
OL,18,Fwith a friend on Thursday morning, and
OL,19,Fwas about to cross into Minsmere Woods
OL,20,Fwhen she "heard a crackle".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
