OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785559663
OL,3,C'I heard a crackle': Woman on moment
OL,4,Cshe believes Suffolk wildfire started
OL,6,F"My friend, who was with me, said 'I
OL,7,Fsmell smoke' so we both looked down
OL,8,Fand there quite a way down...was a
OL,9,Fcircle of fire," she said.
OL,11,F"It was not big, it was like maybe 20
OL,12,Ffeet across, and so...we were jumping
OL,13,Fon it trying to stamp it out.
OL,15,F"I think if we had fire beaters we
OL,16,Fmight have been able to get it out,
OL,17,Fbut there was just no way because it
OL,18,Fsuddenly lit the heather and leapt up
OL,19,Fto a Scots Pine."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
