OL,3,C'I heard a crackle': Woman on moment
OL,4,Cshe believes Suffolk wildfire started
OL,6,FDu Cann said she rang the fire brigade
OL,7,Fimmediately and ran across the Heath
OL,8,Fto tell the nearby National Trust.
OL,10,FShe said the area where the fire was
OL,11,F"off the path" and that there was no
OL,12,Fcigarette butt or camping equipment
OL,13,Faround.
OL,15,F"I don't know what started it," Du
OL,16,FCann said. "There was nobody around."
