OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785559663
OL,3,C'I heard a crackle': Woman on moment
OL,4,Cshe believes Suffolk wildfire started
OL,6,F"It's like a tinderbox out there," she
OL,7,Fadded. "It was devastating. I live
OL,8,Fhere, this is my heartland."
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fdeclared a major incident after the
OL,12,Fblaze broke out on Thursday morning.
OL,13,FBy the afternoon, the fire had spread
OL,14,Fto around 150 hectares, an area
OL,15,Froughly equivalent to 210 football
OL,16,Fpitches.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
