OL,3,C'I heard a crackle': Woman on moment
OL,4,Cshe believes Suffolk wildfire started
OL,6,FThe scale of the blaze has grown
OL,7,Frapidly and is expected to continue
OL,8,Fburning for another two days, but
OL,9,Ffirefighters say efforts to contain it
OL,10,Fare "moving in the right direction".
OL,12,FCrews remained at the scene again
OL,13,Fovernight on Thursday, working across
OL,14,Fthree sectors with a rolling programme
OL,15,Fof relief crews.
OL,17,FThe fire is burning close to the
OL,18,FSizewell B nuclear power station and
OL,19,Fthe construction site of the new
OL,20,FSizewell C plant.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
